This licence covers the files in this directory (src/formats): .vox chunks
read and written byte for byte, glTF/GLB, OBJ, PLY and STL out, glTF/GLB,
OBJ and STL in, GIF, PNG, ZIP, Radiance .hdr and palette files (.gpl, .hex,
.pal, .act). They import nothing from the rest of the editor, which a check
of the build enforces, so they can be copied into other programs on their
own. Turning .vox chunks into the editor's scene (src/io) is part of the
editor and stays under its AGPL-3.0-or-later.
